    <briefdescription>
<para>Concrete <computeroutput>ITextGenerationBackend</computeroutput> that delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_plugin_manager" kindref="compound">LLMPluginManager</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is the <bold>only</bold> class that bridges the ingestion module and the LLM module. It lives in <computeroutput>llm/</computeroutput> so the <computeroutput>ingestion/</computeroutput> module never needs to include any <computeroutput>llm/</computeroutput> headers.</para>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1autotoc_md3_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1autotoc_md3">
<title>Dependency flow (SoC / DIP compliant)</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">ingestion/<sp/><sp/>→<sp/><sp/>ITextGenerationBackend<sp/><sp/><sp/>(abstract,<sp/>in<sp/>ingestion/)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>↑<sp/>implemented<sp/>by</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">llm/<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>→<sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1a7a692095b292adf76658613d7f75ce0f" kindref="member">LlmIngestionBridge</ref><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>(concrete,<sp/>in<sp/>llm/)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>↓<sp/>calls</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>→<sp/><sp/>LLMPluginManager::instance().<ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1ab82e3f06259721fe8d480c5100ad9142" kindref="member">generate</ref>()</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1autotoc_md4_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1autotoc_md4">
<title>Wiring (main.cpp / server bootstrap)</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;<ref refid="llm__ingestion__bridge_8h" kindref="compound">llm/llm_ingestion_bridge.h</ref>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;ingestion/llm_adapter.h&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>bridge<sp/><sp/>=<sp/>std::make_shared&lt;LlmIngestionBridge&gt;();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Optional:<sp/>override<sp/>the<sp/>model/adapter<sp/>via<sp/>LlmAdapterConfig<sp/>in<sp/>LegalLlmAdapter.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ingestion::LegalLlmAdapter<sp/>adapter(bridge);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">adapter.setConfig({<sp/>.model_path<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;/models/mistral-7b.Q4_K_M.gguf&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.adapter_path<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;/adapters/legal-lora.gguf&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.temperature<sp/><sp/>=<sp/>0.1<sp/>});</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Thread-Safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_llm_ingestion_bridge_1ab82e3f06259721fe8d480c5100ad9142" kindref="member">generate()</ref></computeroutput> delegates to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_plugin_manager_1a553b72956aa08cda9d84e2d94e8909c7" kindref="member">LLMPluginManager::generate()</ref></computeroutput>. The <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_l_l_m_plugin_manager" kindref="compound">LLMPluginManager</ref></computeroutput> is thread-safe (shared mutex + atomic queue depth). </para>
</sect2></sect1>
